            {!<td style="background-color: rgba(144, 144, 144, 0.2); font-size: 0.85em;">!}[+ catholics_other_display +]%[? if n_elections != 1 and demo_change_catholics_other_display != 0 : ([+ demo_change_catholics_other_display +])?]{!</td>!}
